  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.49 Evaluator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.49 “Evaluator” means a person who has completed the practical examination evaluator training and education (PEETE) program, and who has applied and been approved by the division to be part of the state authorized practical examination team and serves as an observer and recorder of skills performed by a candidate.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
